# Wave T56 (Palmside kit): palmshade — a shade palm: a curved ringed trunk rising to a full frond crown with two coconuts at its base, its shadow pooled on the grass south-west. The painting's palm shade and the town's own namesake dressing, at the front lawn's two shoulders, east of the flower plot and on the south-west lawn. Fully opaque; the town grass is baked in at its measured colours (tg-sunnyshore #008100/#003f00). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T56-PALMSIDE-PLAN.md §5.)
